chapter.v:
Wash yourselves; 


make yourselves, 


clean; remove the evil of your deeds from before my eyes; cease to do evil,

“Come now, 


let us, 


reason(3) together, says the LORD: though your sins are like scarlet, they shall be as white as snow; though they are red like crimson, they shall become like wool.

If you 


are willing, 


and obedient, you shall eat the good of the land;
